DESCRIPTION:Organizer: OCPL - Rancho Santa Margarita Branch\\nCost: free\\
 nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Music & Dance\\n\\nBy appointment\n\n \n\n 
 \n\nBasic Computer Tutoring: Receive assistance using one of the library
 ’s public access computers. Progress at your own pace with guidance spec
 ific to your computer needs (e.g. navigating the web\, introductory ChatGP
 T/Gemini and other popular AI interfaces\, MS Office\, resumes\, creating 
 and using an email account\, filling out online applications\, and more).\
 n\n\nTech Time: Receive assistance using your smart device to access OC Pu
 blic Libraries’ most popular apps including MyOCPL\, Libby\, Hoopla\, Fr
 eegal\, and Mango.\n\n \n\nVisit the Service Desk or contact us by phone o
 r email to request an appointment.\n\n949-459-6094\, ext. 3\n\nocpl.rsm@oc
 cr.ocgov.com\\n\\nMore info: https://ocpl.libcal.com/event/17131808
