 m &#8211\; 12pm\nMartin Bruinsma is a fine art painter with works in Mexic
 o City\, New York City\, Beverly Hills and Genoa Italy.  He has had sol
 o shows in Bergamot Station in Santa Monica. He has a BFA in Illustrati
 on from Art Center College of Design.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendc
